	(text "Battery retention is only needed for\nthe RTC. The rest of the NVSRAM data is\nbacked up in the flash on the RP2350B."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 162.814 204.216 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "0ad7d5cc-596c-4fd8-b7e5-64ae2425c4f3")
	)
	(text "When this board is plugged in the scope,\nonly connect the Core2350B to USB with the\nUSB connector on this board, not with the\nUSB extension board + flex cable that comes\nwith the Core2350B."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 287.02 22.352 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "2fa4bc21-e298-4d77-acbc-37304b661bd3")
	)
	(text "Core2350 is either powered from VBUS or connector 5V,\nbut we don't want it start unless the 3V3 is active on the\nconnector, to avoid backdriving into the scope when\nUSB is plugged in but the scope is off.\n\nThe JP8 is closed by default to make sure\nthat RP2350 doesn't get accidentally switched on. \n\nThe JP7 on the OR'ed 5V is to measure power."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 355.346 84.582 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "556cbcde-bd5e-4e85-b8a6-99307e101216")
	)
	(text "3V3 is generated on the Core2350,\nso this is an output."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 194.818 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "81d21172-05f1-47fc-a49b-87a4187245d0")
	)
	(text "The Core2350 has a 100k \npullup to 5V on 3V3_EN. With\na 200k to ground, the 5V gets\nreduced to 3.3V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 383.286 113.284 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "9793f8c5-03c6-4690-a3ca-2408d308ecdc")
	)
	(text "BDM_HRESET on the MCP860 is bidirection and\nopen drain. GPIO39 is also connected to an LED on the\nCore2350B. Reset is active low. This circuit\nredrives HRESET and makes it active high on the \nCore2350B side."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 239.268 212.344 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "a820b59f-f6b3-4c8e-acd0-a186c7e66e6e")
	)
	(text "Only support one-bit SDIO.\nSPI is not supported."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 382.524 164.084 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b96df1f5-6838-4650-ab61-c3ae7a34f354")
	)
	(text "BDM_SRESET is not needed: it gets asserted inside the CPU \nwhen HRESET is asserted.\n\nnTA has a scope-side pullup.\n\nD15-D8 are assumed to be connected to D7-D0 on the scope.\nThe schematics on EEVblog are hopefully incorrect."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 41.402 183.642 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f424eb3b-2628-408c-8b56-f1bc6f60759d")
	)
	(text "This is a PCB \"connector\", not the expensive\nConnectivity AMP Connectors 1-1734099-0.\nThe pinout is different the real connector\nso that we can reuse a standard SAMTEC footprint."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 79.248 18.034 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "f6f1f469-c59b-4b7d-9ec6-039ed84caca2")
	)
